# Libraries the ```python samples in the other .claude/skills packs import (languages/python.md,
# frameworks/*.md, testing/*.md, databases/*.md, infrastructure/*.md, core/*.md), on top of
# requirements.txt. Current stable releases, vetted with .claude/guard/vet-package.py and resolved
# 2026-09-30 for Python 3.12. requirements-packs.txt is the lock, compiled with the archetype lock as
# constraints so a library both use stays on one version:
#   uv pip compile requirements-packs.in -c requirements.txt -o requirements-packs.txt --python-version 3.12

